{"at": "2026-11-04T06:59:44+00:00", "action": "discovery_recorded", "detail": {"kind": "observed", "note": "2026-11-04: Whole-site minimal redesign built and browser-checked on branch codex/minimal-redesign (all routes, 390/768/1440, light and dark). Owner has not yet chosen between it and the navy branch (T-002 still open). T-006 would only be needed if the navy branch is chosen.", "source": "design-explorations.md", "at": "2026-11-04T06:59:44+00:00"}}
{"at": "2026-11-04T06:59:45+00:00", "action": "discovery_recorded", "detail": {"kind": "observed", "note": "2026-11-04: Owner decided canonical address is www.aeoluslabsltd.com. Implemented on codex/minimal-redesign (metadataBase, sitemap, robots, titles, theme colour). Applies to T-007 on either branch; still to be applied on the navy branch if chosen.", "source": "DESIGN.md", "at": "2026-11-04T06:59:45+00:00"}}
{"at": "2026-11-04T06:59:45+00:00", "action": "discovery_recorded", "detail": {"kind": "observed", "note": "2026-11-04: On codex/minimal-redesign the unused Tailwind/shadcn toolchain was removed; pnpm audit fell from 85 to 5 findings, all inside Next's own build tooling (partly addresses T-011). Solutions grey tile (T-012) and dead code (T-008) no longer exist on this branch. Navy branch still has all three.", "source": "package.json", "at": "2026-11-04T06:59:45+00:00"}}
{"at": "2026-11-04T07:11:23+00:00", "action": "discovery_recorded", "detail": {"kind": "observed", "note": "2026-11-04: App icons added on codex/minimal-redesign: apple-icon.png 180 (opaque, iOS), icon.png/icon.svg/favicon.ico (tabs), manifest with 192, 512 and maskable 512 PNGs (Android), iOS home-screen title. Built from the supplied-reference logo recreation; swap in final brand artwork if supplied (T-004). Served files and head tags checked on a production build; not yet tested by installing on a real iPhone or Android phone (T-009). Old v0 placeholder images removed.", "source": "app/manifest.ts", "at": "2026-11-04T07:11:23+00:00"}}
{"at": "2026-11-04T08:04:25+00:00", "action": "discovery_recorded", "detail": {"kind": "observed", "note": "2026-11-04: T-003 wiring done on codex/minimal-redesign. Owner added RESEND_API_KEY in Vercel (Production only per screenshot). Code now needs only the key (sender defaults to enquiries@aeoluslabsltd.com, override with ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL); on missing key or Resend failure it returns a prepared mailto with an honest message and logs the cause; best-effort 5-per-15-min limit per IP per instance. Public DNS shows Resend DKIM and send-subdomain SPF/MX published and Google MX for info@. Tested locally: no key, invalid key (Resend 401 then fallback), rate limit (6th request 429), foreign origin 403, honeypot 400. NOT verified: a real email arriving in info@ (needs deploy + redeploy after env change), Resend dashboard shows domain Verified, Vercel Firewall rate-limit rule.", "source": "app/api/enquiries/route.ts", "at": "2026-11-04T08:04:25+00:00"}}
